"Every message is included, from top (oldest) to bottom (newest). The four lanes show System, User, Assistant, and Tool messages. Height and width encode compressed UTF-8 text length, not measured transcript height. Very dense messages occupy subpixels.\n\nThe outlined band is the transcript’s visible range. The dotted line is the keyboard target; it can differ while a jump is pending. Click to jump. Up/Down, Page Up/Down, and Home/End jump through messages. Return or Space repeats a jump. Tab leaves the map. Open All messages for an accessible list and exact message-number navigation." = "包含所有消息，从顶部（最早）到底部（最新）排列。四列分别表示系统、用户、助手和工具消息。高度和宽度表示压缩后的 UTF-8 文本长度，并非对话内容的实际显示高度。消息非常密集时可能小于一个像素。\n\n带边框的区域表示对话内容的可见范围。虚线表示键盘目标，跳转尚未完成时，它可能与可见范围不同。点击即可跳转。上、下方向键、Page Up / Page Down 和 Home / End 可在消息间跳转。Return 或 Space 重复跳转。Tab 离开地图。打开“所有消息”可使用无障碍列表，并按准确的消息编号跳转。";
